    "d27ae55c-7517-4498-be98-fc7a4429469d": {
      "type": "section-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "template--19595896914241__d27ae55c-7517-4498-be98-fc7a4429469d-1688025346f4ef4f44-0": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "collapse": true,
            "title": "Can I connect speakers to my TV?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes, you can connect speakers to your TV. Most TVs have audio output options, such as HDMI, optical audio, or analog RCA connectors, which can be used to connect external speakers or audio systems. Do you want more information? Please contact us.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": true
          }
        },
        "template--19595896914241__d27ae55c-7517-4498-be98-fc7a4429469d-1688025346f4ef4f44-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "collapse": true,
            "title": "What is the difference between bookshelf and floor-standing speakers?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Bookshelf speakers are typically smaller and designed to be placed on shelves, stands, or mounted on walls. They are more suitable for smaller rooms or as part of a surround sound setup. Floor-standing speakers, also known as tower speakers, are larger and are designed to stand on the floor. They often provide a fuller and more powerful sound, making them ideal for larger rooms or as standalone stereo speakers.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
        "template--19595896914241__d27ae55c-7517-4498-be98-fc7a4429469d-1688025346f4ef4f44-2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "collapse": true,
            "title": "Can I use Bluetooth to connect my devices to speakers?",
            "icon": "none",
            "header_image_width": 25,
            "faq_answer": "<p>Yes, many modern speakers come with Bluetooth connectivity, allowing you to wirelessly connect your devices such as smartphones, tablets, or laptops to the speakers and play audio without the need for physical cables.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "image_width": 465,
            "liquid": "",
            "html": "",
            "show_contact_form": false
          }
        },
